  "Bryan Johnson's zero-blood, at-home physical testing battery. Track your functional biomarkers against elite 18-year-old and longevity longevity percentiles.": "Bryan Johnsoni nullvereline, kodus testitav aku. Jälgige oma funktsionaalseid biomarkereid 18-aastaste eliidi ja pikaealisuse pikaealisuse protsentiilide suhtes.",
  "Bryan measures grip strength as a primary longevity biomarker (scoring ~60 kg, top 5% of all ages). Hanging decompresses the spine and builds forearm grip endurance.": "Bryan mõõdab haardetugevust kui peamist pikaealisuse biomarkerit (skooriga ~60 kg, 5% kõigist vanustest). Rippumine vähendab lülisamba survet ja suurendab küünarvarre haarde vastupidavust.",
  "Bryan on X: 10 squats every 45 minutes of sitting": "Bryan X: 10 kükki iga 45 minuti järel istudes",
