  "Bryan: back extensions 1 × 25 on a 45° bench holding a 20 kg plate. This is the floor version.": "Bryan: seljapikendused 1 × 25 45° pingil, mis hoiab 20 kg kaaluvat taldrikut. See on põranda versioon.",
